 21 years old, Gandhi joined the National Congress party and became active in the fight for India's independence."}, {"time": "33000", "image": "engenn6le02ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "India, which used to be a British colony, would separate from Britain in 1948. Gandhi's father, Jawaharlal Nehru, was the first Prime Minister of the independent country. As Nehru's only daughter, Gandhi used to look after her father. She would greet guests and look after them in her father's absence. Gandhi used to serve as his confidante and would accompany him on foreign trips from time to time."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Famous People"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Indira Gandhi"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le02ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Remember, you use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "She was elected twice."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She became the Prime Minster of India."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.</br> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.</br> Irregular verbs change in different ways."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Regular Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular  Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"elect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"elected\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"consider\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"considered\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"become\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"became\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"involve\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"involved\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fight\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"join\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"joined\\\"}\",\"\",\"\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Used to and Would to Talk About Past Habits"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the expressions <span class =\"strong\">used to</span> and <span class =\"strong\">would</span> to talk about events or activities that were usual or repetitive in the past. You may use them to describe past routines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You used <span class =\"strong\">USED TO</span> with all types of verbs, including general condition or specific actions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class =\"strong\">used to </span>talk about politics.</span> <br /><span class=\"italic\">Indira <span class =\"strong\">used to</span> look after her father.</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\">India  <span class =\"strong\">used to</span> be a British colony.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " You used <span class =\"strong\">WOULD</span> when there is a specific time for the action to happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">India <span class =\"strong\">would</span> separate from Britain in 1948.<br /> Indira <span class =\"strong\">would</span> accompany her father on foreign trips from time to time.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class =\"strong\">USED TO</span> or <span class =\"strong\">WOULD</span> followed by the basic form of the verb (infinitive). "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class =\"strong\">would</span> read about India when I was at school.<br /> I <span class =\"strong\">used to</span> love Indian history.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "prime minister"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the name for a leader of the government in some countries "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Indira Gandhi was the Prime Minister of India."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you can use to talk about Indira Gandhi. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to elect"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be chosen for an official position through voting"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She was elected twice to be Prime Minister of India."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "term of office "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the time someone spends doing an important job for the  government"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her first term of office was from 1966 to 1977. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "powerful"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a strong effect on someone's feelings or opinions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She was considered one of the most powerful women in politics. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "politics"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "ideas and activities relating to gaining and using power in a country"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Indira was involved in politics from a young age."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fight for"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of trying to achieve something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She joined the fight for India's freedom."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "independence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "political freedom from the government of another country"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: India fought for its independence from Britain. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "confidante"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a female you tell your secrets to or talk to about personal things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She would serve as his confidante. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le02ob05aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you could interview Indira Gandhi. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down 7-10 questions you would ask her. Be creative."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice reading your questions aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions about a person."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about past experiences. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice my interview questions aloud."}]}]}